    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20231" root="سكر" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكِّيرٌ</span></b>  One <i>who intoxicates himself much,</i> or
<i>often; a drunkard; a tippler;</i> (K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْكِيرٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكُورٌ</span></b>  (IAar, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكِرٌ</span></b> :
(K:) or <i>constantly intoxicated:</i> (S:) the pl. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكِرٌ</span> is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُكَارَى</span>, which is also pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكْرَانُ</span>. (TA.)

